From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Jurgens <danielj@nvidia.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Feb 2026 22:14:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 168/254] virt: tegra_hv: move IVC layout declarations to
 tegra_hv_ivc.h

Move struct tegra_hv_guest_area, tegra_hv_notify_info,
tegra_hv_ivc_layout and the related function declarations
(tegra_hv_ivc_layout_init, tegra_hv_ivc_layout_release,
tegra_hv_get_max_qid, tegra_hv_add_ivc_interrupts,
tegra_hv_ivc_reserve_id, tegra_hv_ivc_unreserve_id) from
tegra_hv.h to tegra_hv_ivc.h.

This allows out-of-tree modules such as tegra_hv_nvscicom to
include tegra_hv_ivc.h instead of tegra_hv.h, avoiding
redefinition errors caused by overlapping declarations
between tegra_hv.h and hv-ivc.h.

tegra_hv.h now includes tegra_hv_ivc.h for backward
compatibility.

Bug 5628239

Change-Id: I8717661aa037de5d321bce870f407a410a4c036a
Signed-off-by: Dan Jurgens <danielj@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-on: https://git-master.nvidia.com/r/c/3rdparty/canonical/linux-noble/+/3545240
Reviewed-by: svcacv <svcacv@nvidia.com>
GVS: buildbot_gerritrpt <buildbot_gerritrpt@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-by: Aparna Das <aparnad@nvidia.com>
(cherry picked from commit 6875009f39ed9fc696a990b3377d2def495912f9)

