+ *
+ * @post
+ *                 - layout structure will be initialized with IVC info
+ *
+ * @usage
+ *                 - Allowed context for the API call
+ *                   - Interrupt handler: No
+ *                   - Signal handler: N/A
+ *                   - Thread-safe: No
+ *                   - Async/Sync: Sync
+ *                   - Re-entrant: No
+ *                 - API Group
+ *                   - Init: Yes
+ *                   - Runtime: No
+ *                   - De-Init: No
+ */
